rl":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/120978.patch","merged_at":"2026-07-06T15:45:01Z"},"body":"## What problem(s) does this PR solve?\r\n\r\nWhen working with `Ref<Script> scr` there is both `scr.is_valid` coming from `Ref` and `scr->is_valid` coming from `Script`.\r\n\r\nThis is easy to miss in a review. To make things worse, when using `clangd` for autocompletion it will silently convert `.` to `->` on accepting the completion.\r\n\r\nI'm not aware of any regressions caused by this. But I'd still like to address the foot-gun preemptively.\r\n\r\n## Additional information\r\n\r\nTo appease the compat gods, the virtual method on `ScriptLanguageExtension` is still called `_is_valid`.\r\n","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/120978/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":2,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/120978/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null}